<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-NATAL BEAT WAIKATO CHIEFS IN SUPER 12.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NATAL BEAT WAIKATO CHIEFS IN SUPER 12.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal of South Africa beat the Waikato Chiefs 33-15 (halftime 13-8) in Friday's Super 12 rugby match at Albany Stadium in Auckland.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Natal - Tries: Adrian Garvey (2), Carbous van der Westhuizen. Penalties: Gavin Lawless (4). Conversions: Gavin Lawless (3).</p>
<p>Waikato Chiefs - Tries: Glen Osborne, Glenn Taylor. Penalties: Blair Feeney. Conversion: Blair Feeney.</p>
